        <item>
            <title>3.17.5</title>
            <pubDate>Wed, 28 Oct 2026 08:43:37 +0900</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/Saqoosha/Canopy</link>
            <sparkle:version>201</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>3.17.5</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Changes
- A session Canopy Mobile was opening is no longer closed on the Mac when the phone's connection drops before the session finishes starting, for example when the app goes to the background. The phone reconnects to the session that is already running. This prepares for the Canopy Mobile update that waits while the Mac starts a session.
]]></description>
