        <item>
            <title>3.17.4</title>
            <pubDate>Tue, 27 Oct 2026 23:53:00 +0900</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/Saqoosha/Canopy</link>
            <sparkle:version>200</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>3.17.4</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Bug Fixes
- Fixed a pane closing after 15 seconds when this Mac's session service took longer than that to start the session, while the session still started and stayed in the open list without a pane. The pane now waits while the session starts. If you close the pane or it gives up, the session it was opening is closed too.
- The message shown when a session does not finish opening no longer says "Could not reach this Mac's session service" when the service did answer.
]]></description>
