        <item>
            <title>3.17.3</title>
            <pubDate>Tue, 27 Oct 2026 21:04:34 +0900</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/Saqoosha/Canopy</link>
            <sparkle:version>199</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>3.17.3</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Bug Fixes
- Fixed reopening a session with a very large transcript (hundreds of MB) failing on the first try: the pane closed after about 15 seconds while the session stayed in the open list, and Canopy Mobile reported "The Mac did not answer the attach." Opening such a session now starts right away.

### Changes
- Removed the message-count badge from the status bar. Counting it meant reading the whole transcript every time a session opened.
]]></description>
